[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-08): `freecad`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked at a
later version. The request needs `so:libSoQt.so.20`, which the installed
`soqt` 1.6.4-r0 provides and needs `so:libQt5Core.so.5`, and which the
repository's `soqt` 1.6.4-r1 provides needing nothing. apk keeps `soqt`
and upgrades the installed `qt5-qtbase` under it, which brings
`icu-data-full`, where it could upgrade `soqt` and remove `qt5-qtbase`.
Observed; the rule is not yet known.

